,"amp":false},{"slot":"passive","req":4,"plus_star":null,"base":[0,0],"plus":[0,0],"maxlv":10,"cad":0.0,"anim":1,"exec":false,"score":false,"amp":false}],"intf":{"atk":5,"label":"Isabelle +ATK"},"echarge":400,"ehits":0,"estacks":4,"engage":0.9,"dodgeVal":0,"dodgeCd":5,"dodgeDur":0.5,"blockRate":30,"staggerRate":0.1}},"fight_s":180,"_meta":{"interference":"per-witch carry-facing interference deltas (percent points): cr=crit rate, cd=crit dmg, crEx=extreme-only crit rate, atk=ATK, spd=atk speed, ex=extreme-dmg, nrm=normal-dmg, glob=global bonus, mental/physweak=conditional. Stacking parts pre-averaged. Applies only to a same-class core; solver assigns best 2 off-team same-class owned carries.","venomTax":"multiplier on the carry's extreme-damage share vs Venomfrill, from the extreme's hit count self-stacking the boss's extreme-resistance (~5.88%/stack of hit1, cap 4, floor .765). 1.0 = amp/single-hit extreme (immune).","stack_debuff":"Venomfrill damage-reduction: each extreme HIT on the boss applies a stack (flat -6% ALL incoming damage, 20s, cap 4 rank1-4 / 6 Endless). Team S_avg = MIN(cap, sum over team of ehits*20*chargeRate/echarge); charge period P=echarge/chargeRate. Applied team-wide to scored damage. echarge=extreme charge cost, ehits=extreme damage-instance count.","reactive_and_selfbuff":"Dodge-Counter specials use a reactive cadence (fire on dodge). Attack-speed class/passive self-buffs added as selfbuff{speed,uptime} (applied to the normal portion). Uptimes are estimates pending clock calibration. 2-Physical law's +dodge is an offensive boost for dodge-counter carries (TODO: model as damage, currently still defensive).","dodge_model":"Real defensive stats from class_base_stats + stat_overrides. dodgePot=(dodgeVal/100)/dodgeCd. dodgeRate=dodgePot*(boss.aoe+(1-boss.aoe)*engage). Feeds Yuhong/Alice passive via sum of teammate dodgeRate. Venomfrill aoe=0.23, kd=0.089 measured from a full Endless fight (4 screams+spit screen-wide; 2 knockdowns).","stagger_model":"Per-unit staggerRate = sum(skill stagger x frequency). Team kd derived: teamStagger x (1.5 if 2+ S/A/V) vs boss.staggerThreshold; each fill = boss.kdDur knockdown. Venomfrill threshold=255, kdDur=8 (calibrated to a mapped Endless fight: Yun+Zhijie+Doroa+Yuhong -> 2 knockdowns). Frequencies are estimates absorbed by the threshold; relative team stagger is the signal."}}